        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "During 2025, we implemented two strategic restructuring actions designed to sharpen operational focus and align resources with our long‑term strategy to successfully complete the 4WARD trial in patients with moderate and severe CN.",
