        "statement": "In 2022, we conducted a proof-of-concept Phase 1b open-label, multicenter study designed to assess the safety and tolerability of oral mavorixafor, with or without injectable G-CSF, in patients with CN disorders, including idiopathic, cyclic, and congenital neutropenia.",
